Bias detection introduces a new method for quantifying the orientation of model responses towards demographic groups, which is an original contribution to the field. Identifying a pleasant resolution builds upon this by proposing a novel approach to mitigate bias through word choice adjustments and vector manipulations in embedding spaces. Prompt Rewriting consumes knowledge from previous sections but adds value by detailing how to apply the identified pleasant resolutions practically, which is essential for real-world applications of the paper's findings.
